{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7e4c5bc0-a9ab-8fba-a3d0-48b549d29aee",
  "created_at": "2025-12-23T10:31:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. Buenos días, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:28:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning, Rosa. Dennis McCarthy. Quick question, do you take complaints about people who think seven o'clock is for sleeping in? Because I've got a crew that doesn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:28:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, okay. A noise complaint, you mean? Construction noise?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:28:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, construction. A crew starts up before seven in the morning. Saws, a compressor, trucks backing up with the beeping. Six-fifteen this morning, I'd say, maybe earlier."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:28:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And is this a one-time thing or has it been happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's been going on since Monday. So yesterday and today, both days, same thing. I figured I'd call before it turns into the whole week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:28:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where is the work happening? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:28:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "304 Ocean Avenue. That's the Ocean Drive side. I own a place nearby and my tenants are the ones getting woken up, so my phone's been going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:29:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 304 Ocean Avenue. Let me make sure I have that right, three-oh-four?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:29:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three-oh-four, yep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:29:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what do you want to happen? You'd like a report taken?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:29:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'd like a report taken, on the record. I'm not looking to start a war with anybody. I just want somebody to tell them what the hours are."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:29:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Sorry, I hear a lot of noise on your end. Are you somewhere busy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at the copy shop, standing here making a stack of flyers. Machine's chugging away. Hang on, let me step toward the door. [pause] Better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:29:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Much better. So I'll put down construction starting before seven a.m., Monday and Tuesday, at 304 Ocean Avenue. Do you know which company it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No name on the truck that I could see. White pickup and a dump trailer. There's a sign on the fence maybe, I didn't walk up close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:30:06-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, they can look into it. The inspection side handles permits and work hours, so I'll send this over to them. I can't tell you exactly when someone will go out, with the holiday this week it may be slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, Christmas. Figures. Will somebody call me back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Possibly. What's the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0167. That's my cell, so if I don't pick up, leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-seven. Okay, and your name again, spelled?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:30:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dennis. McCarthy, M-C-C-A-R-T-H-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:30:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. If it starts up again tomorrow morning before seven, call back and tell us the time it began. That helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. I'll write it down on the back of one of these flyers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:30:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good idea. Anything else, Mr. McCarthy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:31:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Thanks, Rosa. Appreciate you taking it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:31:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Feliz Navidad, take care."
    }
  ],
